WEBVTT

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:10.760
This is getting fun, isn't it, 
fail-faced Gayus?

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:15.450
A 14th-rank Mechaswordsman and a Trickster...

00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:20.560
And a Protean transformed 
into a pseudo-fire dragon.

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:21.950
There's nothing we can do.

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:24.960
But for some reason, I don't feel 
like I'm going to lose or die.

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:29.710
Give me the exact equation that'll 
turn your hunch into reality.

00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:35.050
Let's go.

00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:16.260
Gigina!

00:01:20.320 --> 00:01:21.010
Gigina!

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:33.530
Isn't that...

00:01:42.490 --> 00:01:46.000
<b>Goddess of Revenge</b>

00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:51.240
Nidvork...

00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:52.970
You're finally here.

00:01:56.600 --> 00:01:59.140
All that's left to do is to 
defeat the witch and take her.

00:02:11.770 --> 00:02:12.770
What?

00:02:36.680 --> 00:02:38.470
This, a dragon?

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:39.660
Not a chance.

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:45.420
Begone.

00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:47.470
I have no need for you two.

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:52.120
<i>Terrified?</i>

00:02:52.120 --> 00:02:53.420
<i>Me?</i>

00:02:55.860 --> 00:02:56.540
Brother...

00:02:56.540 --> 00:02:59.220
Beldritt, we're sticking to our plan.

00:02:59.940 --> 00:03:01.900
All right, Brother.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:12.370
Not done yet!

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:18.260
Beldritt!

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:25.520
Not even a Trickster, a manipulator of 
probabilities, can escape from gravity.

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:27.010
This is nothing but troublesome.

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:30.200
No matter what happens,

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:33.770
we must complete our mission 
for the honor of the Laki family.

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:35.130
Brother...

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:41.400
Perish.

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:46.890
Don't die!

00:03:51.220 --> 00:03:53.790
I won't let you die.

00:03:54.640 --> 00:03:56.620
<i>The</i> Laki brothers are taking a beating.

00:03:57.320 --> 00:03:59.740
This is a surprising turn of events.

00:03:59.740 --> 00:04:02.800
I never expected her to have such power.

00:04:03.330 --> 00:04:05.550
Intriguing.

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:10.150
We're going to need Gayus 
and Gigina to hang in there.

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:13.310
Are you afraid of me?

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:15.550
No.

00:04:15.550 --> 00:04:18.800
Now, it's the final act of the festival.

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:21.800
I look forward to the fireworks.

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:28.620
You saved our lives.

00:04:29.030 --> 00:04:32.700
I can't allow them to kill you.

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:35.180
I must tear you apart with my own hands.

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:36.580
Nidvork...

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:39.740
You're a black dragon

00:04:39.740 --> 00:04:44.020
and the wife of a black dragon 
we defeated before, aren't you?

00:04:45.890 --> 00:04:48.720
A gravity Jushikiist with an odd name.

00:04:49.480 --> 00:04:53.230
No human could fly 
under the radar with power like that.

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:58.240
Furthermore, the scrap of your 
clothing that was on Gigina's sword

00:04:58.240 --> 00:05:00.040
resembled the scales of a reptile.

00:05:00.040 --> 00:05:02.880
It's an insult to treat us like reptiles.

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:04.730
Pardon me.

00:05:05.220 --> 00:05:08.220
But why bother to take human form?

00:05:08.220 --> 00:05:09.840
It's a vow.

00:05:09.840 --> 00:05:11.990
I swore to my beloved

00:05:12.440 --> 00:05:16.620
that I would give you 
another—your second—death.

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:19.750
<i>Stop!</i>

00:05:20.120 --> 00:05:20.990
No...

00:05:20.990 --> 00:05:21.980
That's right.

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:27.260
I cast a dragon's spell to bring 
you back from the brink of death.

00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:28.320
Why?

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:29.510
What for?

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:31.390
Why else?

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:35.640
To tear you apart with my own hands
 for taking my beloved from me.

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:38.520
It's over.

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:44.390
Now, I will crush you to avenge my beloved.

00:05:56.260 --> 00:05:57.540
She's coming!

00:06:06.170 --> 00:06:07.930
An Arsh Modai!

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:13.560
There's no way she could use her 
Jushiki to fly, perform powerful attacks,

00:06:13.900 --> 00:06:16.270
and deploy a barrier all at the same time.

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:17.620
There's no point.

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:21.840
So long as this gem stays with me.

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:27.070
Now, are you ready?

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:35.870
Gayus!

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:36.890
Gayus!

00:06:36.890 --> 00:06:38.030
Gayus!

00:06:38.030 --> 00:06:40.080
Wake up, you wussy rearguard!

00:06:46.230 --> 00:06:51.180
Was I... Don't tell me I was...

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:52.700
You were dead for a moment.

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:53.350
But...

00:06:54.630 --> 00:06:56.850
I won't let you die so easily.

00:06:57.490 --> 00:07:02.070
I'll kill you a hundred times, revive you 
a hundred times, and then kill you again.

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:04.110
Let's go, Gayus.

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:05.240
Yeah.

00:07:05.240 --> 00:07:07.130
Who do you think you're talking to?

00:07:07.130 --> 00:07:09.860
Go be a wall, you defective 
sword-swinging machine!

00:07:10.440 --> 00:07:15.440
It seems we've been making the mistake 
of employing anti-human tactics.

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:18.040
We're fighting against a dragon.

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:22.770
One with a gem and 
unstoppable gravity Jushiki.

00:07:22.770 --> 00:07:23.880
This is laughable.

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:26.440
A 900 to 1,000-year class.

00:07:26.440 --> 00:07:29.380
Nidvork must be a true Altar.

00:07:29.740 --> 00:07:30.510
What to do?

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:32.260
Don't ask me.

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:34.490
Well, sorry, pardon me.

00:07:34.490 --> 00:07:36.510
I asked you to do something 
physically impossible.

00:07:36.880 --> 00:07:40.270
How much intellect do you think I have?

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:41.520
About as much as an insect.

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:44.270
Are you done with your last words?

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:49.020
Then here we go.

00:07:56.900 --> 00:08:00.270
They're neutralizing the 
Proke acid with Phoneus.

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:01.660
That's clever.

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:03.440
That's not all.

00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:06.400
With their streams having connected...

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:07.790
Now!

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:36.340
It's over!

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:50.570
It's finally over.

00:08:57.890 --> 00:09:00.220
Well? Does it hurt?

00:09:07.590 --> 00:09:09.480
This is just the beginning.

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:13.490
Savor the pain.

00:09:21.430 --> 00:09:23.240
I won't let you die yet.

00:09:23.240 --> 00:09:28.250
My beloved Eningiluud suffered far more.

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:38.260
Damn it, I can't think of a way to defeat her.

00:09:38.760 --> 00:09:41.610
Here's a question.

00:09:41.610 --> 00:09:44.770
What's the surprising way to do it?

00:09:45.490 --> 00:09:51.130
Send the tax inspectors after a tax officer 
who's on the verge of committing suicide

00:09:51.130 --> 00:09:53.640
because of debts and a pending divorce.

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:56.650
Yeah, that would kill her.

00:09:56.650 --> 00:10:02.300
If you have some cheap plot twist about 
having actually being the descendant

00:10:02.300 --> 00:10:06.890
of a demon king or a super-Draken family 
or some shit, now would be a good time.

00:10:06.890 --> 00:10:09.580
I'll let you get away with it just this once.

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:14.140
Unfortunately, it seems that for 
my true power to be revealed,

00:10:14.140 --> 00:10:16.810
a friend has to die.

00:10:17.350 --> 00:10:18.250
But...

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:24.350
Even when you were 99 percent dead just now,

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:26.930
nothing happened.

00:10:28.180 --> 00:10:31.690
You don't feel anything even when I die?

00:10:32.120 --> 00:10:37.690
Maybe I'll try dying for real, then.

00:10:42.060 --> 00:10:45.080
I won't allow you to escape 
into death, even for a moment!

00:10:48.240 --> 00:10:51.880
Oh, by the way, do you remember that Jushiki?

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:54.550
<i>Sure I do, Helodel.</i>

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:58.020
<i>I'm a 13th-grade Jushikiist now.</i>

00:10:58.020 --> 00:11:00.380
<i>If only you'd been alive...</i>

00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:03.390
<i>Revenge is just stupid.</i>

00:11:03.390 --> 00:11:06.640
Everyone is dumb as hell!

00:11:19.530 --> 00:11:23.670
I'm using your Par Ee Mon, Helodel.

00:11:52.790 --> 00:11:54.940
Die later.

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:04.950
You win...

00:12:08.800 --> 00:12:13.460
Why did you take that Jushiki head-on?

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:18.820
She simply couldn't evade it.

00:12:19.820 --> 00:12:25.090
So she would never lose her beloved again.

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:33.080
It's my beloved.

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:36.860
I wanted to fight alongside him.

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:44.020
I want to ask you a question.

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:47.910
If you want to avenge your husband,

00:12:48.600 --> 00:12:54.460
why didn't you kill my lover, Jiv?

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:57.460
You knew where she lived.

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:02.010
What are you talking about?

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:08.900
It was the two of you who killed my beloved.

00:13:10.520 --> 00:13:16.520
Though it was someone else 
who attacked me out of fear.

00:13:17.140 --> 00:13:22.030
No other human, 
including the ones you love,

00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:24.780
were responsible in any way, were they?

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:31.830
I have done enough.

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:39.060
I want to hold my beloved
close in the afterlife.

00:13:39.720 --> 00:13:43.720
The way we used to.

00:13:46.170 --> 00:13:54.280
But would Eningiluud recognize 
me when he meets me?

00:13:55.110 --> 00:14:01.240
I, who has not fulfilled my vow?

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:06.780
That alone is my fear.

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:09.370
I'm scared.

00:14:29.040 --> 00:14:32.720
Are you awake, Patient 4970701?

00:14:33.380 --> 00:14:34.670
Czahn.

00:14:34.670 --> 00:14:35.360
That's right.

00:14:35.360 --> 00:14:38.060
Your kind, kind female doctor.

00:14:38.060 --> 00:14:40.810
Kind in all ways except billing.

00:14:42.920 --> 00:14:45.050
That's right, and then...

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:49.340
Thank goodness, I still have human hands.

00:14:49.340 --> 00:14:50.960
What do you mean by that?

00:14:50.960 --> 00:14:53.520
Are you suggesting that my treatment 
could have failed in any way?

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:56.540
Your healing Jushiki is first-rate.

00:14:56.540 --> 00:14:59.000
But your personality is unhinged.

00:14:59.600 --> 00:15:03.100
Last time, you tried to switch
my nose out with a dog's!

00:15:03.100 --> 00:15:04.990
It was fancy-looking.

00:15:04.990 --> 00:15:07.620
A dog's sense of scent 
would be useful, after all.

00:15:09.410 --> 00:15:10.300
Say...

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:12.760
Will this do this time?

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:14.120
I'll pass.

00:15:14.120 --> 00:15:17.080
You're in the service sector. 
Honor your customers' demands.

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:18.640
Then shall I perform surgery

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:23.270
to make your disappointingly average-shaped 
and average-sized penis larger?

00:15:23.640 --> 00:15:26.460
A simple operation could 
make it 1.35 times larger.

00:15:26.460 --> 00:15:28.510
Your girlfriend would be delighted.

00:15:28.510 --> 00:15:30.440
1.35?

00:15:31.350 --> 00:15:32.670
I'm fine with being average.

00:15:32.670 --> 00:15:35.060
I don't need more than love and technique.

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:41.540
You look boring, but your 
organs sure are beautiful.

00:15:42.200 --> 00:15:46.540
As an organ artist, 
I guarantee it, with some jealousy.

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:48.830
I'm going to get dressed. Go somewhere else.

00:15:48.830 --> 00:15:50.650
Preferably to hell.

00:15:51.890 --> 00:15:54.680
Oh yeah, someone came to see you.

00:15:55.440 --> 00:15:58.540
It was a monster.

00:16:00.070 --> 00:16:02.310
Human towns are nice.

00:16:03.080 --> 00:16:06.180
Chaotic and beautiful.

00:16:07.030 --> 00:16:12.140
Did you come to end me, 
Your Eminence Cardinal Mouldeen?

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:13.920
Of course not.

00:16:13.920 --> 00:16:18.030
Gigina and I went to hell and back 
for the sake of your entertainment.

00:16:18.030 --> 00:16:21.450
My Jesper and Beldritt are 
critically injured, too.

00:16:21.450 --> 00:16:27.390
Genon is floating in a vat with only 
his brain, spinal cord, and heart.

00:16:27.390 --> 00:16:29.210
We took a lot of damage.

00:16:30.440 --> 00:16:32.810
You win this time.

00:16:32.810 --> 00:16:34.160
Congratulations.

00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:37.940
No, it was all according to your script.

00:16:38.630 --> 00:16:41.420
All of the events were connected

00:16:41.420 --> 00:16:45.640
Your true goal is equilibrium 
between the Dragon Empire,

00:16:45.640 --> 00:16:49.210
the Seven-City Alliance, 
and the dragon kind Vaisen.

00:16:49.700 --> 00:16:51.290
Continue.

00:16:51.290 --> 00:16:54.700
First, you kicked the hardliners, who are 
opposed to the Holy Land of Alsok's ceding,

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:59.320
out of the assembly using your 
rigged self-assassination attempt.

00:17:00.150 --> 00:17:02.380
Meanwhile, for the Seven-City Alliance,

00:17:02.380 --> 00:17:07.520
you promised to mediate the once-failed 
Tienlun Accord in the future,

00:17:07.520 --> 00:17:11.270
creating favorable conditions 
for Alsok's ceding.

00:17:11.270 --> 00:17:16.010
I suspect you masterminded 
the first failure, too.

00:17:16.690 --> 00:17:21.960
You traded the needs of 
the three powers in order.

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:24.640
To the Dragon Empire, the Holy Land;

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:27.470
to the Alliance, the accord; 
and to the dragons...

00:17:28.340 --> 00:17:31.520
Looks like you finally found the answer.

00:17:31.520 --> 00:17:32.280
Yeah.

00:17:32.880 --> 00:17:38.030
You paid the dragons back by having 
the two Vaisen defectors hunted down.

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:39.100
Which means...

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:42.410
Gigina and I were good bait for Nidvork,

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:45.850
having killed Eningiluud.

00:17:45.850 --> 00:17:48.350
You got us involved under the 
guise of making us guards,

00:17:48.350 --> 00:17:51.480
when in fact, you had us dancing in 
the palms of the Winged Generals.

00:17:51.480 --> 00:17:55.300
And on the fishing hook you've 
attached to us, Mouldeen,

00:17:55.780 --> 00:17:58.380
is the potent poison that is you.

00:17:58.820 --> 00:18:00.300
Poison, huh?

00:18:00.300 --> 00:18:05.710
The dragon's proud sense of revenge 
led her to swallow the poison and die.

00:18:05.710 --> 00:18:08.820
This is the exact outcome 
that you had plotted out.

00:18:12.050 --> 00:18:13.740
Well done.

00:18:13.740 --> 00:18:15.290
But one thing...

00:18:15.290 --> 00:18:16.860
It's hard to imagine that the only thing

00:18:16.860 --> 00:18:19.260
you've offered to the dragons 
was the two of them.

00:18:19.260 --> 00:18:19.870
There must be more.

00:18:19.870 --> 00:18:21.900
I can't tell you about that.

00:18:23.400 --> 00:18:25.840
In any case, the Winged Generals failed,

00:18:25.840 --> 00:18:28.360
but my insurance policy, 
you two, was successful.

00:18:28.360 --> 00:18:29.660
Thank goodness.

00:18:29.660 --> 00:18:30.990
Insurance policy?

00:18:30.990 --> 00:18:32.460
Then you're...

00:18:34.440 --> 00:18:39.840
Even if the actors were to improvise, 
even if they abandon the script,

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:44.040
I trap them inside the stage that 
is the stage outside the stage.

00:18:44.530 --> 00:18:49.600
A true playwright must make 
the entire world their stage.

00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:51.600
Don't you agree?

00:18:52.800 --> 00:18:56.670
Then why did you make me read the script?

00:18:56.670 --> 00:18:58.430
You're an observer.

00:18:58.430 --> 00:19:01.370
An event without an observer doesn't exist.

00:19:01.370 --> 00:19:08.030
A spectacular closing requires 
the ambiguity of mystery.

00:19:08.030 --> 00:19:10.090
But why me?

00:19:10.090 --> 00:19:13.630
For what wretched plan are you here?

00:19:14.130 --> 00:19:17.760
Well, Gigina, you seem as well as ever.

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:21.530
My earnest prayers must have reached God.

00:19:21.530 --> 00:19:23.360
Which God?

00:19:23.360 --> 00:19:25.510
The God that you wish for.

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:30.770
I should have lopped your head off 
and your rotten brain with it.

00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:38.250
There, there, I wanted
to congratulate you two.

00:19:38.250 --> 00:19:43.280
And it's right to provide an excellent 
costar with fame and a prize.

00:19:43.280 --> 00:19:46.330
I have no interest in receiving
so much as a molecule from you.

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:47.580
What about you, Gayus?

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:51.760
This is unsettling and unpalatable, 
but I agree with Gigina.

00:19:51.760 --> 00:19:53.040
That's unfortunate.

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:54.820
Here, then.

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:57.850
Your Eminence, that's...

00:20:01.080 --> 00:20:03.370
I'll leave this here as a prize.

00:20:03.370 --> 00:20:05.640
Take it or leave it. It's up to you.

00:20:05.640 --> 00:20:08.310
But it's a truly valuable ring.

00:20:09.520 --> 00:20:10.310
I...

00:20:13.280 --> 00:20:15.810
I don't approve of your methods.

00:20:18.600 --> 00:20:20.520
I won't be defeated.

00:20:22.020 --> 00:20:25.550
If it'll protect the modest 
lives of the meek,

00:20:25.550 --> 00:20:29.790
I'll gladly destroy the 
dragons and the abhorrent,

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:33.080
and cackle in the face of any Jushiki curse.

00:20:34.800 --> 00:20:38.590
I'll prove that the weakness 
and brittleness of man

00:20:39.360 --> 00:20:42.590
is sufficient for us to live on.

00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:51.910
That we are humans...

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:55.350
to the ends of the earth.

00:21:01.990 --> 00:21:03.220
Well, then...

00:21:08.760 --> 00:21:10.290
Oh, right.

00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:13.120
Do you two have any interest 
in joining the Winged Generals?

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:16.440
You'll be paid handsomely and 
be given excellent benefits.

00:21:16.440 --> 00:21:17.380
Nope.

00:21:18.280 --> 00:21:19.940
That's a shame.

00:21:21.990 --> 00:21:24.840
You've finally begun to stand on your own.

00:21:27.170 --> 00:21:30.860
We'll meet again when 
you overcome yourselves.

00:21:32.140 --> 00:21:34.390
May you be blessed by the blade and the moon.

00:21:34.810 --> 00:21:38.300
It's hard not to be wounded by that sarcasm.

00:21:44.790 --> 00:21:47.000
It's really over this time.

00:21:47.000 --> 00:21:48.380
It seems so.

00:21:48.960 --> 00:21:51.640
What the hell did we accomplish, anyway?

00:21:52.950 --> 00:21:55.880
I don't know of a purpose, but I live.

00:21:55.880 --> 00:21:58.000
And so do you.

00:21:58.000 --> 00:21:59.770
That's good enough.

00:22:11.890 --> 00:22:16.680
That's all that matters 
to us Offensive Jushikiists.

00:22:16.680 --> 00:22:17.770
Yeah.

00:22:18.440 --> 00:22:21.450
What a blunder, admitting 
that you're the same as me.

00:22:21.450 --> 00:22:24.410
People will question my values and dignity.

00:22:25.840 --> 00:22:27.180
Say, Gigina...

00:22:27.180 --> 00:22:27.820
Yes?

00:22:28.800 --> 00:22:31.160
Would you mind dying, like, right now?

00:22:35.810 --> 00:22:37.710
Why would you do such a thing?

00:22:37.710 --> 00:22:39.830
Who do you think I am?

00:22:42.090 --> 00:22:44.830
I'm Zenon of the Aurora Front!

00:22:44.830 --> 00:22:47.210
I'm the leader of your party!

00:22:47.210 --> 00:22:49.450
You're no longer the party leader.

00:22:50.610 --> 00:22:51.840
N-No...

00:22:52.820 --> 00:22:56.090
I thought you were dead.

00:22:56.760 --> 00:22:59.820
You'll be punished for your betrayal.

00:23:01.690 --> 00:23:04.790
Let's make you useful one last time.

00:23:05.750 --> 00:23:06.610
No!

00:23:19.120 --> 00:23:23.440
Najik, Navarro, we'll hereby summon disaster.

00:23:23.440 --> 00:23:25.610
I'll have your lives.

00:23:26.070 --> 00:23:28.600
I'm well-prepared.

00:23:28.600 --> 00:23:30.130
As am I.

00:23:31.730 --> 00:23:34.140
Begin the revenge.

00:23:34.510 --> 00:23:36.870
This is the first call.

00:23:37.840 --> 00:23:43.030
I curse this world, which does 
nothing but take from the weak.

00:23:44.020 --> 00:23:45.690
We awaken today.

00:23:45.690 --> 00:23:48.710
The iron hammer comes with the dawn.

00:23:50.990 --> 00:23:54.650
People take no interest in that 
which doesn't interest them.

00:23:54.650 --> 00:23:57.580
Praise, slander, obedience, hostility...

00:23:57.580 --> 00:24:00.750
None of this occurs until one is 
interested in the object of such.

00:24:00.750 --> 00:24:04.760
Disinterest is perhaps the 
best way to destroy a person.

00:24:02.500 --> 00:24:05.000
<b>Bad Omen</b>
